<title>JAPAN: Toyo Communication to issue 13 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Toyo Communication to issue 13 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Toyo Communication Equipment Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Sumitomo Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   2	  AMT   13 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.May.97   CONV TO 29.Sep.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 31.Mar.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 25.Mar-28.Mar</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on March 24.</p>
</text>
